WEBVTT

00:04.330 --> 00:09.150
Our window verified the 
curse womb three hours ago.

00:09.920 --> 00:12.390
Once 90 percent were successfully evacuated,

00:12.390 --> 00:15.140
they made the call to seal off the center.

00:15.610 --> 00:18.030
Road Closed

00:15.950 --> 00:19.890
Citizens within a 500-meter radius 
have been evacuated, as well.

00:21.310 --> 00:22.810
Ijichi-san, question.

00:23.130 --> 00:24.680
What's a "window" here?

00:24.930 --> 00:29.720
A window is a member of 
Jujutsu Tech who can see curses.

00:30.060 --> 00:31.740
They aren't sorcerers, though.

00:31.940 --> 00:33.620
Oh, okay.

00:33.620 --> 00:34.840
Let's continue.

00:35.690 --> 00:37.700
Detainee Block 2.

00:38.340 --> 00:43.310
At present, five detainees 
remain there with the curse womb.

00:43.670 --> 00:46.300
If this curse womb is the 
type that metamorphoses,

00:46.710 --> 00:50.480
we predict it will become 
a special-grade cursed spirit.

00:50.900 --> 00:51.990
Special-grade...

00:52.450 --> 00:56.900
Hey, so... I still don't really understand 
what "special-grade" means.

00:58.000 --> 01:01.420
Then allow me to explain it so 
even idiots can understand.

00:58.700 --> 01:08.460
*If Conventional Weapons Were Effective Against Cursed Spirits

00:58.700 --> 01:08.460
Grade 4

00:58.700 --> 01:08.460
A wooden bat is enough

00:58.700 --> 01:08.460
Grade 3

00:58.700 --> 01:08.460
If you have a handgun, you can rest easy

01:02.080 --> 01:03.490
First, there's grade 4.

01:03.490 --> 01:05.390
A wooden bat is enough for them.

01:05.390 --> 01:06.290
Grade 3.

01:06.290 --> 01:08.180
If you have a handgun, you can rest easy.

01:08.290 --> 01:13.960
Grade 3

01:08.290 --> 01:13.960
If you have a handgun, you can rest easy

01:08.290 --> 01:13.960
Grade 2

01:08.290 --> 01:13.960
Close call with a shotgun

01:08.290 --> 01:13.960
Grade 1\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h

01:08.290 --> 01:13.960
Even a tank may be insufficient

01:08.740 --> 01:09.510
Grade 2.

01:09.510 --> 01:11.040
It'll be a close call with a shotgun.

01:11.040 --> 01:11.840
Grade 1.

01:11.840 --> 01:13.730
Even a tank may be insufficient.

01:13.730 --> 01:14.980
Then there's special-grade.

01:13.960 --> 01:19.100
Close call with a shotgun

01:13.960 --> 01:19.100
Grade 1\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h

01:13.960 --> 01:19.100
Even a tank may be insufficient

01:13.960 --> 01:19.100
Special-Grade

01:13.960 --> 01:19.100
Even footing with a carpet bombing of cluster bombs\h\h\h\h\h

01:14.980 --> 01:19.100
Let's say you might be on even footing if 
you carpet bomb it with cluster bombs.

01:19.270 --> 01:20.630
That's real bad!

01:20.630 --> 01:24.880
Normally a jujutsu sorcerer on par with 
the cursed spirit would take on the mission.

01:25.440 --> 01:28.020
On a day like today, 
that would be Gojou-sensei.

01:28.020 --> 01:29.230
I-I see.

01:29.770 --> 01:31.930
So where is Gojou-sensei?

01:32.240 --> 01:33.610
Away on business.

01:33.610 --> 01:34.460
Huh?

01:34.460 --> 01:38.800
He's not someone who should be loafing 
around at the school in the first place.

01:39.190 --> 01:41.030
Don't expect any souvenirs.

01:41.280 --> 01:45.110
Unfortunately, we're constantly 
short-handed in this business.

01:45.810 --> 01:48.990
You'll often have to undertake 
missions beyond your power.

01:50.240 --> 01:54.480
The current case, however,
is an abnormal one, and most urgent.

01:54.480 --> 01:56.550
Do not fight under any circumstances.

01:56.550 --> 01:59.020
If you encounter a special-grade,

01:59.020 --> 02:01.100
your options are to either run or die.

02:03.010 --> 02:06.100
Please just listen to your fears.

02:06.490 --> 02:08.640
Do not forget that your mission here

02:08.640 --> 02:11.900
is strictly the verification 
and rescue of survivors.

02:11.900 --> 02:12.690
Excuse me!

02:12.690 --> 02:14.220
Excuse me, where's Tadashi?!

02:14.220 --> 02:15.540
Stop! Stay back!

02:15.540 --> 02:16.840
Please stay back!

02:16.840 --> 02:20.590
Is Tadashi... Is my son Tadashi all right?!

02:20.920 --> 02:22.350
Please calm down!

02:21.470 --> 02:22.820
Hey, stop it!

02:22.830 --> 02:23.640
Let go of me!

02:22.830 --> 02:25.010
Please stay back! It's dangerous!

02:23.640 --> 02:24.810
Let me through!

02:24.810 --> 02:26.710
She's a guardian who was here for a visit.

02:27.220 --> 02:28.860
Please step away.

02:28.860 --> 02:32.910
There's a possibility that someone has 
spread poisonous gas throughout the center.

02:33.500 --> 02:36.670
We cannot share any more details at this time.

02:36.670 --> 02:37.740
No...

02:39.650 --> 02:41.400
Why?

02:42.140 --> 02:45.050
Why is this happening?!

02:47.300 --> 02:49.270
Fushiguro, Kugisaki.

02:50.040 --> 02:51.120
We're gonna save them!

02:51.640 --> 02:52.710
Of course we are.

03:04.990 --> 03:11.950
Jujutsu Kaisen

04:24.990 --> 04:26.660
Block 2

04:25.990 --> 04:32.040
Episode 4: Curse Womb Must Die

04:25.990 --> 04:32.040
Episode 4: Curse Womb Must Die

04:29.590 --> 04:30.690
Be careful.

04:32.820 --> 04:34.360
I'll put up my Veil.

04:34.950 --> 04:37.260
Emerge from darkness, blacker than darkness.

04:37.470 --> 04:39.470
Purify that which is impure.

04:47.200 --> 04:49.040
It's becoming night!

04:49.040 --> 04:50.120
It's Veil.

04:50.120 --> 04:52.410
There's a residential area nearby,

04:52.410 --> 04:54.780
so this barrier conceals us 
from the outside world.

04:54.780 --> 04:56.070
That's incredible!

04:56.070 --> 04:57.290
Ignorant.

04:58.450 --> 04:59.190
Demon Dogs!

05:04.800 --> 05:07.370
He'll let us know if the curse gets close.

05:07.370 --> 05:09.270
Oh, I see!

05:09.270 --> 05:12.620
Good boy, good boy! We're counting on you, okay?

05:16.000 --> 05:16.780
Let's go.

05:20.580 --> 05:21.470
Wait!

05:24.710 --> 05:26.180
What is this?

05:26.810 --> 05:29.240
Wh-What's going on in here?

05:29.510 --> 05:32.660
This is a two-story dorm, isn't it?

05:32.910 --> 05:36.020
C-C-Calm down! It's a maisonette.

05:36.020 --> 05:37.280
No, it's not.

05:37.920 --> 05:40.670
It's the deployment of an 
Innate Domain due to cursed energy.

05:41.130 --> 05:43.420
It's my first time seeing one this big.

05:44.480 --> 05:45.290
Where's the door?!

05:45.500 --> 05:46.200
Huh?

05:46.470 --> 05:49.240
Th-The door's gone!

05:49.240 --> 05:52.400
How?! We just came in 
through here, didn't we?!

05:52.550 --> 05:55.290
What do we do? 
Ah, what do we do about this?

05:54.560 --> 05:55.290
It'll be fine.

05:55.780 --> 05:58.500
The dog remembers the scent of the entrance.

05:58.500 --> 06:00.430
Oh, my!

06:00.430 --> 06:02.660
Good boy! Have some jerky!

06:02.660 --> 06:04.880
Have all the jerky you want!

06:04.880 --> 06:06.340
You are way too calm!

06:06.340 --> 06:08.670
You really are dependable, Fushiguro.

06:09.040 --> 06:12.520
Thanks to you, we'll be able to 
rescue people and save ourselves, too.

06:15.770 --> 06:16.940
Let's keep moving.

06:48.670 --> 06:49.690
Atrocious.

06:50.080 --> 06:52.820
That's... three people, right?

06:53.300 --> 06:55.640
Okazaki Tadashi

06:57.740 --> 07:01.350
Is Tadashi... Is my son Tadashi all right?!

07:02.700 --> 07:04.810
Let's take this body back.

07:05.250 --> 07:06.200
Huh?

07:06.200 --> 07:07.880
It's that woman's son.

07:07.880 --> 07:08.880
But...

07:08.880 --> 07:10.620
His face isn't too badly mangled.

07:10.920 --> 07:15.270
His mother won't accept it if we tell 
her he's dead, but we don't have a body.

07:17.920 --> 07:20.480
We have to find and verify two more.

07:20.480 --> 07:22.080
Leave that body behind.

07:22.080 --> 07:23.560
Quit joking around!

07:23.560 --> 07:25.940
We turned around, and the way 
we got in here was gone!

07:25.940 --> 07:27.820
We won't be able to come back for it later!

07:27.820 --> 07:30.850
I didn't say to come back for it! 
I said to leave it behind!

07:31.890 --> 07:34.190
I have no intention of risking my own life

07:34.190 --> 07:37.460
to save someone I had no intention 
of saving in the first place!

07:38.230 --> 07:41.500
No intention of saving him? 
What do you mean?!

07:42.140 --> 07:43.860
This is a juvenile detention center.

07:43.860 --> 07:47.600
Jujutsu sorcerers are granted access to 
all information about the scene beforehand.

07:48.900 --> 07:50.610
This Okazaki Tadashi

07:50.610 --> 07:54.300
hit a little girl on her way home from 
school while driving without a license.

07:52.150 --> 07:55.120
Youth's Name | Date of Birth
Okazaki Tadashi | August 9th, 2001
Highest Education | Sakakidate High School 
Date of Detention | July 20, 2017
Family History | Only has his birth mother, Okazaki Chisaki (42)...
...gone missing, and cannot be contacted...
...living with his mother in an apartment in Eishuu City...

07:55.330 --> 07:57.620
It was his second offense 
of driving without a license.

07:59.320 --> 08:04.410
I know you're stuck on saving lots of people 
and guiding them to proper deaths.

08:05.040 --> 08:09.820
But what are you going to do when someone 
you saved kills someone else in the future?

08:11.280 --> 08:13.600
Then why did you bother saving me?!

08:15.940 --> 08:17.480
Cut it out!

08:17.480 --> 08:20.800
Christ, what are you two doing?!

08:20.800 --> 08:22.250
You're both idiots!

08:22.250 --> 08:24.950
Think about the time and place if you—

08:26.990 --> 08:28.700
Kugisaki?

08:28.820 --> 08:31.580
No way! Demon Dogs should 
have sensed the curse!

08:35.520 --> 08:36.370
Itadori!

08:37.360 --> 08:38.460
We're running!

08:38.460 --> 08:41.100
We'll search for Kugisaki la—

08:46.640 --> 08:47.900
There's no mistake.

08:48.260 --> 08:49.690
It's a special-grade.

08:49.690 --> 08:50.810
I can't move.

08:51.440 --> 08:52.390
Move.

08:52.800 --> 08:55.590
Move! Move! Move! Move!

08:56.640 --> 08:58.400
Help others.

09:09.680 --> 09:11.160
Itadori?

09:13.630 --> 09:14.200
Huh?

09:18.800 --> 09:21.900
Damn it, where am I?

09:21.900 --> 09:23.910
It's so dark, I can't see a thing.

09:26.590 --> 09:27.710
The curse's presence!

09:29.270 --> 09:31.270
How can there be so many?!

09:36.420 --> 09:37.120
Nue!

09:47.730 --> 09:50.470
Don't die on me, Itadori and Kugisaki!

09:52.170 --> 09:54.960
I can't escape after it's gotten this close!

09:56.360 --> 09:57.600
Hey, Sukuna!

09:57.600 --> 09:59.560
If I die, you die too, right?

09:59.990 --> 10:02.000
If you don't want that, then help me out!

10:02.400 --> 10:03.450
Nope!

10:03.720 --> 10:05.960
Even if the parts of me inside you die,

10:05.960 --> 10:09.480
there are eighteen other fragments of my soul.

10:09.990 --> 10:15.350
Still, irritatingly enough, 
I don't have control of this body.

10:15.350 --> 10:17.650
If you want to switch, go ahead and switch.

10:17.650 --> 10:19.470
But once you do,

10:20.180 --> 10:23.410
I'll kill that brat before the cursed spirit can!

10:24.260 --> 10:25.630
Then I'll go for that woman!

10:25.630 --> 10:28.800
She's a lively one. I'll have fun with her.

10:29.520 --> 10:31.480
I'm not going to let you do that.

10:31.600 --> 10:32.800
I bet.

10:33.290 --> 10:37.610
But if you're too focused on me, 
your friends are gonna die.

10:44.800 --> 10:46.320
It's not jujutsu.

10:47.580 --> 10:50.010
He just unleashed pure cursed energy.

10:53.700 --> 10:54.620
Fushiguro!

10:55.110 --> 10:56.150
Fushiguro!

10:56.720 --> 10:58.130
Fushiguro!

10:59.190 --> 11:01.480
Take Kugisaki and get out of here!

11:01.790 --> 11:05.060
I'll keep this one busy 
until you two are out.

11:05.650 --> 11:08.320
As soon as you're out, 
give me some kind of signal.

11:08.590 --> 11:12.690
Once you do... I'll switch with Sukuna.

11:12.890 --> 11:14.550
You know you can't do that!

11:14.550 --> 11:16.610
Not with only one arm against a special-grade!

11:16.610 --> 11:17.920
Look closer.

11:18.810 --> 11:20.290
It's having fun.

11:20.290 --> 11:22.950
It's obviously toying with us.

11:23.300 --> 11:25.430
I can at least buy us some time.

11:25.740 --> 11:26.880
No!

11:26.880 --> 11:28.080
Fushiguro!

11:30.060 --> 11:31.010
Please.

11:34.190 --> 11:35.180
Demon Dogs!

11:38.660 --> 11:40.300
Find Kugisaki!

11:43.970 --> 11:46.230
This is my last one.

11:48.260 --> 11:51.460
I should've brought a lot more with me.

12:00.670 --> 12:03.910
Trying to say it's easier to move 
around in your underwear?

12:04.250 --> 12:05.790
What do I do, though?

12:05.790 --> 12:08.550
I have no clue how to use cursed energy.

12:08.960 --> 12:10.510
But for now, that's fine.

12:10.510 --> 12:11.800
I just have to buy ti—

12:18.080 --> 12:21.080
What was that? A cursed energy barrier?

13:01.040 --> 13:02.930
Ow, ow, ow...

13:02.940 --> 13:06.420
It hurts, it hurts, it hurts! Why am I...

13:07.080 --> 13:10.830
If only I hadn't picked up 
that finger back then...

13:12.030 --> 13:13.200
If I hadn't eaten it...

13:13.940 --> 13:14.800
If only...

13:15.390 --> 13:16.360
If only...

13:16.970 --> 13:18.130
Stop!

13:18.130 --> 13:19.380
Don't think!

13:20.890 --> 13:22.220
No! No!

13:22.220 --> 13:24.470
I want to run! I want to run! I want to run!

13:25.200 --> 13:26.740
I don't want to die!

13:28.520 --> 13:29.870
If I died here...

13:29.870 --> 13:31.370
If I actually died...

13:31.600 --> 13:33.440
Would that be a proper death?!

13:37.620 --> 13:41.790
Don't think!

13:43.560 --> 13:45.280
Help others.

13:47.180 --> 13:48.210
Have I...

13:48.910 --> 13:50.790
gotten so weak?

13:54.060 --> 13:56.960
I know your face now.

13:57.210 --> 13:59.150
I swear I'll curse you!

14:13.380 --> 14:15.180
We're escaping, Kugisaki!

14:15.180 --> 14:17.880
I hate frogs, you know.

14:17.880 --> 14:19.170
Yeah, well, sorry!

14:26.930 --> 14:28.220
I was so full of myself.

14:29.620 --> 14:31.440
I thought I was strong.

14:32.440 --> 14:36.180
I thought I was at least strong 
enough to choose when I died.

14:36.760 --> 14:38.330
But I was wrong.

14:39.810 --> 14:42.480
I'm weak!

14:43.660 --> 14:46.490
I'm far too weak!

14:47.310 --> 14:50.500
Augh, I don't want to die!

14:50.960 --> 14:53.280
No! No way!

14:53.280 --> 14:57.220
But... I am going to die!

14:57.960 --> 14:59.620
A proper death?

15:00.170 --> 15:02.830
Yeah, right! Don't be naïve!

15:03.850 --> 15:06.630
Jujutsu sorcerers never die without regret.

15:08.620 --> 15:12.860
Still, I want to be able to say 
my death was a proper one.

15:14.600 --> 15:17.770
The negative emotions of mankind 
become the source of curses.

15:19.110 --> 15:25.030
So all the hate, fear, regret...

15:26.320 --> 15:28.320
Let it all out...

15:29.000 --> 15:31.040
And put it in your fist!

15:44.980 --> 15:46.110
Damn it!

15:49.970 --> 15:51.380
That howl...

15:56.570 --> 15:58.580
It's Fushiguro's signal.

16:06.510 --> 16:09.690
What a thoroughly annoying brat.

16:13.150 --> 16:15.950
Jujutsu Kaisen

16:18.660 --> 16:21.000
Jujutsu Kaisen

16:23.440 --> 16:26.260
What a thoroughly annoying brat.

16:26.880 --> 16:29.570
He's obviously screwing with me.

16:32.390 --> 16:34.950
Hold on a moment. I'm thinking right now.

16:34.950 --> 16:38.850
What can I do to make that brat regret this?

16:41.210 --> 16:45.660
If I went after him, the brat would 
just switch back right beforehand.

16:46.140 --> 16:49.250
So the thing that would cause 
him the most trouble...

16:49.760 --> 16:51.670
is probably this.

16:51.670 --> 16:53.650
I'll put things back the way they were.

16:54.360 --> 16:56.770
Hey, let's go kill some kids.

16:57.760 --> 16:58.870
Follow me.

17:06.740 --> 17:07.580
Idiot.

17:14.690 --> 17:18.110
Ah, shit. I healed this one, too.

17:20.110 --> 17:21.710
You don't like walks?

17:22.440 --> 17:26.510
Well, cursed spirits are usually 
supposed to stay where they're born.

17:26.510 --> 17:28.830
Fine, fine. In that case...

17:29.760 --> 17:32.270
you die here!

17:34.990 --> 17:36.700
Hey, what's the matter?

17:37.200 --> 17:39.360
You're not finished already, are you?

17:42.000 --> 17:45.860
That's it. Come on, try harder.

17:54.500 --> 17:55.930
Even a cursed spirit

17:56.870 --> 17:58.920
would miss their arm, right?

18:16.100 --> 18:18.820
Please expand the evacuation 
area to ten kilometers.

18:18.820 --> 18:20.080
What about you?

18:20.480 --> 18:23.490
I'm waiting here for Itadori to return.

18:23.490 --> 18:24.590
I see.

18:24.870 --> 18:29.950
After I take Kugisaki-san to the hospital, 
I'll return as quickly as possible.

18:30.390 --> 18:33.840
No, there wouldn't be much 
point in you staying here.

18:34.730 --> 18:35.980
If you want to do something,

18:35.980 --> 18:39.460
please ask them to send over 
a sorcerer grade 1 or higher.

18:40.030 --> 18:41.800
Not that I imagine any are around.

18:42.170 --> 18:44.820
I'll do what I can. Later.

18:52.720 --> 18:56.030
If the worst case happens...

18:57.120 --> 18:58.800
I don't want to let him die.

18:58.800 --> 19:00.130
They are.

19:00.130 --> 19:01.530
Please do something about this.

19:03.090 --> 19:06.090
...then it's my responsibility to end him.

19:08.750 --> 19:11.210
Hey, did you know?

19:11.470 --> 19:16.210
We're both classified as 
special-grade, apparently.

19:16.500 --> 19:19.220
Both you and me, man.

19:32.080 --> 19:33.920
Good job, special-grade.

19:33.920 --> 19:35.410
Keep trying.

19:40.050 --> 19:41.880
You look happy.

19:41.880 --> 19:43.390
Want me to praise you?

19:44.070 --> 19:50.790
But healing with cursed energy isn't that hard 
for cursed spirits, unlike for humans.

19:52.210 --> 19:55.390
Neither you nor this brat

19:56.370 --> 19:58.720
really understand

19:59.110 --> 20:01.510
what curses truly are.

20:02.110 --> 20:04.720
This is a good opportunity, 
so I'll show you...

20:05.300 --> 20:07.980
what real jujutsu is.

20:10.300 --> 20:11.910
Domain Expansion.

20:20.520 --> 20:22.300
Malevolent Shrine!

20:29.070 --> 20:31.940
I was planning to cut you in three slices,

20:31.940 --> 20:34.000
but you're really weak.

20:34.850 --> 20:37.960
Oh, yeah, and then there's this.

20:38.560 --> 20:40.440
I'll be taking this.

20:50.450 --> 20:52.000
It's over.

20:55.810 --> 20:57.150
This sucks!

20:57.150 --> 20:59.210
If you're gonna switch, just do it already!

21:03.290 --> 21:05.100
What's the matter, brat?

22:44.960 --> 22:47.510
Juju Stroll

22:47.680 --> 22:49.840
Yes, yes, understood.

22:49.840 --> 22:51.740
Thank you very much.

22:51.740 --> 22:52.520
Yes.

22:52.790 --> 22:54.720
Stare...

22:55.540 --> 22:56.470
What's the matter?

22:56.470 --> 22:59.030
You bow while on the phone.

23:00.350 --> 23:07.030
I just get so wrapped up in creating the feeling 
of "I'm on the phone!" while on a call...

23:07.210 --> 23:08.240
I know what you mean.

23:08.240 --> 23:13.230
I've hurt my neck several times dealing 
with ingrown hairs while depilating.

23:13.230 --> 23:15.290
Of course, I've hurt my pores, too.

23:15.290 --> 23:17.040
Is that really the same?

23:17.230 --> 23:20.570
You're often irritated when 
you're on the phone, Fushiguro.

23:20.570 --> 23:23.700
That's because of Gojou-sensei, 
not the phone.

23:23.700 --> 23:27.320
You often wander around when 
you're on the phone, Itadori.

23:27.320 --> 23:28.690
Speaking of phones,

23:28.690 --> 23:32.800
can you all stay on a call while holding 
the phone against your shoulder?

23:51.530 --> 23:54.990
Episode 5:
Curse Womb Must Die -II-

23:55.010 --> 23:57.010
>>>>oakislandtk<<<<<
www.opensubtitles.org
